    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>6级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 暗影界 类人生物（不死生物）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 18，''强韧'' 16，''反射'' 20，''意志'' 17</span><span>''侦查'' +2</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 疾病，毒素；''抗力'' 10 黯蚀</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 0，飞行 6（盘旋）；相位移动</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}暗影之拥（黯蚀）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+9vs.反射<br>命中：7 点黯蚀伤害，且目标迟缓直到该缚灵下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">暗影滑翔✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该缚灵快步最多 6 格。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（译注：缚灵幻影被官方勘误过，这里按照的是勘误后的版本）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+10</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 3（-1）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 10（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+4）</span><span>''智力'' 4（+0）</span><span>''魅力'' 15（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span></div></div>\n</div>",
